```python id=app_golden
import numpy as np
F1 = np.array([[1, 0, 0, 0], [0, 0, -1j, 0], [0, -1j, 0, 0], [0, 0, 0, 1]], dtype=complex)
p = np.exp(-1j * np.pi / 8)
V = F1 @ np.diag([p, np.conj(p), np.conj(p), p]).astype(complex)
golden = V.conj().T
```
